  "about": {
    "description": "wTBLLx is the ERC-4626 wrapped version of TBLLx (TBLL xStock). It wraps TBLLx into a standardized vault-share token to enable DeFi composability such as use as collateral in lending markets, automated strategies, and other yield protocols. Each wTBLLx represents a share claim on deposited TBLLx. Underlying real-world exposure, redemption mechanics, and reference price tracking are inherited from the underlying TBLLx xStock issued by Backed. The wrapper does not rebase, so its share-to-underlying ratio grows with the xStocks multiplier, making it a total-return tracker rather than a price-parity tracker.",
